nario diagrams/captions explicitly deny execution order and complete coverage/satisfaction; the reader retains stakeholder context and warns that participation is not successful verification."}],"explanation":"Positive repository observations support a bounded contribution; complete MOD-004 criterion contribution in its declared customer scope is not established. Observe a customer Scenario outside fixed RigorLoop reading selections, preserving stakeholder text, selected participation and honest unknown/unprofiled outcomes without coverage or approval inference. Current exact repository Scenario controls are applicable contribution evidence, not that full integration result.","gaps":["Observe a customer Scenario outside fixed RigorLoop reading selections, preserving stakeholder text, selected participation and honest unknown/unprofiled outcomes without coverage or approval inference. Current exact repository Scenario controls are applicable contribution evidence, not that full integration result."],"key":"C5","state":"not-assessed"},{"evidence":[{"limitations":["Specific repository/private-fixture observations; not full customer-profile acceptance."],"source":{"change":"2026-10-04-system-requirements-view-design","id":"criterion-assessment-ar046","identity":"sha256:14d3f8df5b4a8c9289b9f306f00abbd0890dc2f3f55b0a9955f46b27d9be55fc","kind":"verification"},"subjects":[{"identity":"sha256:8d5e4e7cee2dd6280d2127fe86442e1d43f83d9fb7826e902d30a7bc4e890cfa","path":"scripts/lib/rem_architecture_model.py"},{"identity":"sha256:5c7447a3241ef95ea4c3e8444517006e1faf4b30e0306cace0803b5165725932","path":"scripts/lib/rem_architecture_browser.py"},{"identity":"sha256:2ec4643a7735f85cd67b670a34c7aa52e71352ea5c19101e53e0ac5a48358e77","path":"scripts/lib/rem_architecture_realization_diagrams.py"},{"identity":"sha256:10edca5c3931ccac04609d523a0345d51973b83d8c67c6de28fcf058f27d201a","path":"scripts/lib/rem_architecture_scenarios.py"},{"identity":"sha256:82ee7f6c8af02b1b0d51700066e28787c02a